englishSenses.definition:
n. The act or process of grafting by inoculation;
   budding.
n. The application of a plaster or salve.

n. The doctrine that experience, either that
   ourselves or of others, is the test or criterion of general knowledge;
   -- opposed to intuitionists.

a. See Spathic.
a. Having a spathe; resembling a spathe; spatheceous;
   spathal.
